       "speaker": "tom",
       "en": "It's a pen.",
       "zh": "是一支笔。",
       "audio": "L2-3-02.mp3",
       "icon": "pen"
      },
      {
       "id": "L2-3-03",
       "speaker": "amy",
       "en": "Is that a car?",
       "zh": "那是小汽车吗？",
       "audio": "L2-3-03.mp3",
       "icon": "car"
      },
      {
       "id": "L2-3-04",
       "speaker": "tom",
       "en": "No, it isn't. It's a bus.",
       "zh": "不是，那是公共汽车。",
       "audio": "L2-3-04.mp3",
       "icon": "bus"
      },
      {
       "id": "L2-3-05",
       "speaker": "tom",
       "en": "What's this in English?",
       "zh": "这个用英语怎么说？",
       "audio": "L2-3-05.mp3",
       "image": "L2-3-05.jpg"
      },
      {
       "id": "L2-3-06",
       "speaker": "mom",
       "en": "It's an apple.",
       "zh": "是苹果。",
       "audio": "L2-3-06.mp3",
       "icon": "apple"
      },
      {
       "id": "L2-3-07",
       "speaker": "amy",
       "en": "What color is your new book?",
       "zh": "你的新书是什么颜色？",
       "audio": "L2-3-07.mp3",
       "icon": "book"
      },
      {
       "id": "L2-3-08",
       "speaker": "tom",
       "en": "It's red.",
       "zh": "是红色。",
       "audio": "L2-3-08.mp3",
       "icon": "red"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "L2-4",
     "titleZh": "是你的吗",
     "titleEn": "Is This Yours?",
     "lines": [
      {
       "id": "L2-4-01",
       "speaker": "amy",
       "en": "Is this your ball?",
       "zh": "这是你的球吗？",
       "audio": "L2-4-01.mp3",
       "icon": "ball"
      },
      {
       "id": "L2-4-02",
       "speaker": "tom",
       "en": "Yes, it is.",
       "zh": "是的，是我的。",
       "audio": "L2-4-02.mp3",
       "code": "yes",
       "codeIcon": "ball"
      },
      {
       "id": "L2-4-03",
       "speaker": "amy",
       "en": "Is this your hat?",
       "zh": "这是你的帽子吗？",
       "audio": "L2-4-03.mp3",
       "icon": "hat"
      },
      {
       "id": "L2-4-04",
       "speaker": "tom",
       "en": "No, it isn't.",
       "zh": "不，不是。",
       "audio": "L2-4-04.mp3",
       "icon": "stop"
      },
      {
       "id": "L2-4-05",
       "speaker": "tom",
       "en": "Whose hat is this?",
       "zh": "这是谁的帽子？",
       "audio": "L2-4-05.mp3",
       "image": "L2-4-05.jpg"
      },
      {
       "id": "L2-4-06",
       "speaker": "teacher",
       "en": "It's Amy's.",
       "zh": "是艾米的。",
       "audio": "L2-4-06.mp3",
       "image": "L2-4-06.jpg"
      },
      {
       "id": "L2-4-07",
       "speaker": "teacher",
       "en": "Is this yours?",
       "zh": "这是你的吗？",
       "audio": "L2-4-07.mp3",
       "icon": "teddy"
      },
      {
       "id": "L2-4-08",
       "speaker": "tom",
       "en": "Yes, it's mine.",
       "zh": "是的，是我的。",
       "audio": "L2-4-08.mp3",
       "icon": "love"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "id": "L2-5",
     "titleZh": "我的心情",
     "titleEn": "How Do You Feel?",
     "lines": [
      {
       "id": "L2-5-01",
       "speaker": "mom",
